{"title":"Kohei Ohmori&#8217;s Hyperrealistic Pencil Drawings","link":"https://kottke.org/25/01/kohei-ohmoris-hyperrealistic-pencil-drawings","date":1736440130000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/kohei-ohmori-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/kohei-ohmori-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/kohei-ohmori-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1152\" alt=\"hyperrealistic pencil drawing of a bolt sitting on top of a nut\" /></p>\n\n<p>Wow, check out <a href=\"https://www.spoon-tamago.com/kohei-ohmori-pencil-drawings/\">these amazing hyperrealistic pencil drawings</a> by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kohei6620\">Kohei Ohmori</a>. The detail is next-level…here’s a close-up view of the drawing above:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/kohei-ohmori-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/kohei-ohmori-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/kohei-ohmori-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1144\" alt=\"hyperrealistic pencil drawing of the threads on a bolt\" /></p>\n\n<p>This drawing took 280 hours (~11.7 days) over a period of five months. You can check out <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kohei6620\">some BTS and Ohmori’s other work on Instagram</a>. (via <a href=\"https://buttondown.com/clivethompson/archive/linkfest-28-neolithic-octopuses-weeping-trees-and/\">clive thompson</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Kohei%20Ohmori\">Kohei Ohmori</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/01/kohei-ohmoris-hyperrealistic-pencil-drawings\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"1d9c00b7dca30c1c5db733fce537aa41435db965b43eea2191dc6cc971ca24ec","category":"Sites"}